{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26321","headline":"早春残雪 · 施肩吾","name":"早春残雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春景照林峦，玲珑雪影残。\n井泉添碧甃，药圃洗朱栏。\n云路迷初醒，书堂映渐难。\n花分梅岭色，尘减玉堦寒。\n远称栖松鹤，高宜点露盘。\n伫逢春律後，阴谷始堪看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}